    <string name="gesture_hold_body">Speak while holding; when you let go, the text goes in.</string>
    <string name="gesture_double">Double tap: voice command</string>
    <string name="gesture_double_body">With text selected, say what to do with it (“make it more formal”, “translate into Spanish”) and the result replaces the selection. With nothing selected, Voloz writes what you ask for (“reply saying I accept”). Tap again to finish.</string>
